# tier3.ledger — the tier-3 GUI execution ledger (15-06, USPACE-08).
# Line grammar: tier2.ledger's shape; the exec field carries the
# execution evidence pointer — for the traced subjects that IS the
# D-07 rule: the distilled syscall table committed under the phase
# evidence dir, produced by a completion-marker-gated session (the
# raw fragment log sits beside it; both are reconstructible from the
# committed capture).  The utility class rode the venue payload
# (bootfs-draw.paq's /amd64/bin harvest) but has NO independent trace:
# its exec field says so honestly — a utility earns a TRACE: pointer
# when a plan drives it through its own scripted interaction, never by
# inheritance.  sha256 digests are over the /amd64/bin artifacts the
# paq harvest computed from (build/x86_64/tiers/tier3-gui.txt's
# membership; the tier-3 harvest's own T3-ART markers).
# Session runs: 3680ad88f (rio tracer gate), c9d135a45 (acme+sam set,
# the rio+acme+sam one-boot run), the 15-06 Task 3 full-set run
# (rio+acme+sam+rejoin on one capture).
